cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Global CCGT & HRSG Fleet Inventory: a harmonised single-table compilation with capacity, owner, HRSG-unit counts and turbine models"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Aheiev
    given-names: Dmytro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-5512-0291"
    affiliation: Inzonex
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20728927
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://inzonex.co.uk/poweratlas/ccgt-hrsg-fleet/"
abstract: >-
  An open, analysis-ready inventory of 2,813 combined-cycle gas turbine (CCGT)
  power plants worldwide and their heat-recovery steam generators (HRSG) -
  approximately 2,067 GW across 134 countries. Each record carries capacity,
  operating company, commissioning year, lifecycle status, number of HRSG units,
  a CHP flag, gas/steam turbine models (18%) and annual CO2 where available (32%,
  mostly Climate TRACE modelled; EPA/EU ETS subset measured - see co2_basis).
  Compiled and deduplicated from the WRI Global Power Plant Database, Global
  Energy Monitor (GOGPT) and Climate TRACE. A cleaned compilation of open
  sources, not new primary measurement.
keywords:
  - CCGT
  - combined cycle gas turbine
  - HRSG
  - heat recovery steam generator
  - gas turbine fleet
  - power plants
  - waste heat
  - cogeneration
